{"_data": [{"type": "metadata", "contents": [{"type": "lesson_name", "content": "Vanessa Starts Dating Marco"}, {"type": "unit_name", "content": "Leaving a Message"}, {"type": "position", "content": 3}, {"type": "origin", "content": "stub"}, {"type": "lesson", "content": 9}, {"type": "level", "content": "A2.2"}]}, {"type": "achievment_test", "contents": [{"type": "test", "content": "false"}]}, {"type": "objectives", "contents": [{"type": "primary", "content": "Accurately use information about methods of communication and communication technology in common social situations."}, {"type": "secondary_1", "content": "Identifies the expressions and vocabulary necessary for the description of places of work and jobs in common written and spoken situations. "}, {"type": "secondary_2", "content": "Identifies the expressions and vocabulary necessary for the description of places of work and jobs in common written and spoken situations. "}, {"type": "secondary_3", "content": "Identifies the expressions and vocabulary necessary for the description of places of work and jobs in common written and spoken situations. "}, {"type": "secondary_4", "content": "Identifies the expressions and vocabulary necessary for the description of places of work and jobs in common written and spoken situations."}, {"type": "secondary_5", "content": "Identifies the expressions and vocabulary necessary for the description of places of work and jobs in common written and spoken situations."}, {"type": "secondary_6", "content": "Identifies the expressions and vocabulary necessary for the description of places of work and jobs in common written and spoken situations. "}, {"type": "secondary_7", "content": "Identifies the expressions and vocabulary necessary for the description of places of work and jobs in common written and spoken situations."}, {"type": "secondary_8", "content": "Identifies the expressions and vocabulary necessary for the description of places of work and jobs in common written and spoken situations. "}]}, {"type": "background_image", "content": "engenn5le09ob03re1img01.jpg"}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": "Leaving a Message"}, {"type": "describer", "content": "Sometimes, when you call someone, they may not answer the telephone. Then, you may want to leave a message."}, {"type": "text", "content": "When you leave a message, it is important to leave information for the person receiving the message.  </br></br>Here is what you should include:"}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":6,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Example\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Introduction</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">Hello, this is Marco.  </br></br>Hello. My name is David Beare. (more formal)</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Reason for calling </span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">I'm calling  to find out if ... /to see if ... /to let you know that ... /to tell you that ...</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Make a request</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">Could you call me back? </br> Would you mind ... ? </span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Leave your telephone number </span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">My number is ... <br/> You can reach me at ... <br/> Call me at ...</span></br></br><span class=\\\"strong italic\\\">Note</span>: This information is not always needed.\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Conclusion</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">Thanks a lot. Bye. </br>  I'll talk to you later. Bye.</span>\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border instruction_table_background\"}"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Hello, Chelsea. This is Tom. I'm calling to see if you would like to go to the game on Friday. Could you call me back? I'll talk to you later. Bye."}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": "Asking If or When People Are Free"}, {"type": "describer", "content": "When you want to spend time with someone, you ask them if or when they are free. "}, {"type": "example", "content": "I am wondering if you want to see a movie."}, {"type": "example", "content": "If you do, I'll buy you a ticket."}, {"type": "example", "content": "Are you free on Saturday?"}, {"type": "example", "content": "How does tomorrow sound?"}, {"type": "example", "content": "When are you free to walk the dog?"}, {"type": "text", "content": "You use these phrases to ask people if or when they are free:"}, {"type": "text", "content": "I am/was wondering if ... </br>Are you free on/in ... ? </br>How does (day) sound?</br> When are you free to ... ? </br>What day are you free on?"}, {"type": "text", "content": "You can also use the Simple Future tense to talk about the things you would like to do with the person.  </br>For example: <span class=\"italic\">If you are free tonight, we can see a movie.</span>"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "up for (it)"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "interested in"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(expression)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Are you up for going to the movies tonight?"}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn5le09ob03aud01"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "These are words you use when talking to friends."}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "gelato"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "Italian-style ice cream"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I prefer gelato over regular ice cream."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn5le09ob03aud02"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "kind of"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "rather; somewhat"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(expression)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I'm kind of in the mood for ice cream."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn5le09ob03aud03"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "serial killer"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "someone who commits several murders and sometimes in the same way"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Do you want to watch the movie about the serial killer?"}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn5le09ob03aud04"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "chick flick"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a movie that appeals to women"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: That movie is such a chick flick!"}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn5le09ob03aud05"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "Pretend that you are calling your friend. They don't pick up their phone, and you can't text them. You have to leave a voicemail message for them."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Write out your message (60-70 words). Remember to include the important information. Proofread your message."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Practice reading your message aloud."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Listen to a partner's message."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Respond back to their message."}]}, {"type": "takeaway_assessment", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "I talk about free time activities."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I write a voicemail message."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I listen to and respond to a voicemail message."}]}], "labs": [{"stimuli": [{"_data": [], "template_override": 1, "type": "welcome", "contents": [{}], "id": 0}, {"id": 1, "type": "audio", "title": "", "_data": [], "template_override": 1, "contents": [{"type": "slideshow", "value": {"audiosrc": "engenn5le09ob03re2aud01", "coverimg": "engenn5le09ob03re2img08.jpg", "images": [{"text": "", "id": 0, "time": "0", "image": "engenn5le09ob03re2img08.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong\">Marco</span>: Hi, Vanessa. It's Marco! I really enjoyed our walk in the park. I was just calling to see if you're up for going to the movies on Friday? If you are, let me know. I'll buy the tickets before we go. After we see the movie, we'll grab some ice cream if you'd like, or some gelato. Talk to you later.", "id": 1, "time": "100", "image": "engenn5le09ob03re2img08.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Hello?</br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Marco</span>: Hey, Vanessa! </br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Sorry I missed your call. I was reading.</br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Marco</span>: It's okay. Did you listen to my message?", "id": 2, "time": "20500", "image": "engenn5le09ob03re2img11.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Yeah. Which movie are we going to see? </br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Marco</span>: I thought that movie about the serial killer would be exciting to watch.</br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: I don't think so. I kind of want to see <span class=\"italic\">The Life of Rosie</span>.", "id": 3, "time": "29200", "image": "engenn5le09ob03re2img08.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong\">Marco</span>: Maybe we can find something that's between a chick flick and a horror film.</br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Mm... we'll decide on something when we get to the theater.", "id": 4, "time": "41200", "image": "engenn5le09ob03re2img11.jpg"}]}}]}], "_data": [{"type": "lab_options", "contents": [{"